# mini-emacs for mini-9pi (mini-mk O=5 OS=plan9): emacs, the editor
# (../core, ../features, ../modes, ../Config) in a window of mini-rio's,
# painted by the draw device (lib_terminal/hosts: Window_draw, over
# Cells and lib_graphics), and the languages' highlighters (lib_code, languages/*/highlight,
# assembler/highlight; two lexers made by mini-lex); their units from
# their directories, by their names
